# 跨平台换行与二进制规范化（T1 初始化仓库时补充）
# 文本文件统一以 LF 入库，检出时按平台转换；二进制文件不转换、不触发 diff。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理需 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
